A good choice. Before you make your next, would you like me to go over them a bit more?
- yes
	Alright. Units will make up your army during the night.
	There are primarily three archetypes \: melee, ranged, and defensive.
	Melee units are quite basic, attacking at a close range with high damage.
	Ranged units attack at a distance, but are quite frail and flee - even against orders - if approached too closely.
	Defensive units have high effective hp or are trained to take hits. They are usually weak offensively.
	Typically, melee beats defensive, ranged beats melee, and defensive beats ranged.
	Please continue with these notes in mind, sir.
- no
